    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='README'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/DataStreamsVendorsStreamsDataQualityReconciliation/README?rev=' id='README' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/DataStreamsVendorsStreamsDataQualityReconciliation' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style>
        <style-rule element='dash-text'>
          <format attr='vertical-align' id='dash-text_191' value='top' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='900' maxwidth='1440' minheight='900' minwidth='1440' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='127' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98222' id='130' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98888' x='556' y='889'>
            <zone h='98222' id='128' type-v2='layout-basic' w='98888' x='556' y='889' />
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone friendly-name='Dashboard' h='98000' id='7' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='1000'>
          <zone fixed-size='105' friendly-name='Header Container' h='11667' id='9' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='1000'>
            <zone alt-text='Link to slack channel for questions' fixed-size='201' friendly-name='Slack Button' h='11667' id='14' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='Image/Slack Button.png' type-v2='bitmap' url='https://deliveryhero.enterprise.slack.com/archives/C03FHFH1NLX' w='13958' x='800' y='1000'>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                <format attr='margin-top' value='12' />
                <format attr='margin-right' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin-left' value='0' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='977' forceUpdate='true' friendly-name='Dashboard Name Text' h='11667' id='10' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='68403' x='14758' y='1000'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='24'>Data Streams: Reconciliation README</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone alt-text='DH Logo' friendly-name='Delivery Hero Logo' h='11667' id='6' is-scaled='1' param='Image/image 2 (1).png' type-v2='bitmap' w='16039' x='83161' y='1000'>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#d61f26' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='86333' id='153' layout-strategy-id='distribute-evenly' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='12667'>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='86333' id='150' type-v2='text' w='49167' x='833' y='12667'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'>This report aims to provide an overview of the data quality of the KPIs that can be derived from the data that is sent to Data Streams. It is updated daily and the latest date the report has data for can be found in the header above.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'>Please direct questions &amp; feedback to data-platform-governance@deliveryhero.com or in #data-streams-support on Slack.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Vendors Streams KPIs</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'>The platform logic for pulling these KPIs from the platform DWHs can be found in the vendors * scripts in the Data Hub datahub-airflow repo, under dags/coredata.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'>The central logic is based upon Data Streams Vendors Stream. The exact logic of the mapping can be found in reconciliation_vendors_streams.sql</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'>The table is then aggregated for tableau folloing the logic established here: reconciliation_vendors_datastreams_vs_platforms_agg.sql.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'>The KPIs covered in this report are the </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Correctness</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'> of the following KPIs, where correctness is always measured as </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' italic='true'>1 minus the absolute difference between Data Streams and the provided platform reconciliation table value, divided by the platform value</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'>. i.e. any difference, high or low, will reduce the correctness below 100%.</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='86333' id='191' type-v2='text' w='49167' x='50000' y='12667'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Total Vendors-</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'> A comparison of the distinct count of global_entity_id+vendor_id</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Active Vendors-</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'> A comparison of the distinct count of global_entity_id+vendor_id where active=TRUE</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Test Vendors-</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'> A comparison of the distinct count of global_entity_id+vendor_id where test_vendor=TRUE</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Vendor Name Correctness-</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'> A string comparison check on whether the name that Data Streams has for the vendor matches the local DWH</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Chain Name Correctness- </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'>A string comparison check on whether the chain name that Data Streams has for the vendor matches the local DWH</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Chain ID Correctness-</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'> A string comparison check on whether the chain ID that Data Streams has for the vendor matches the local DWH</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Geolocation Correctness-</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'> A comparison as to whether the geolocation Data Streams has for the vendor matches the local DWH</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Delivery Type Correctness-</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'> A string comparison check made by left joining unnested Data Streams delivery types onto the unnested reconciliation table  delivery types. The number of joins/matches will be divided by the total number of cuisines in the reconciliation table to give the correctness.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Vertical Type Correctness- </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'>A string comparison check on whether the vertical type that Data Streams has for the vendor matches the local DWH</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Vertical Type ID Correctness-</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'> A string comparison check made by left joining unnested Data Streams vertical type IDs onto the unnested reconciliation table vertical type IDs. The number of joins/matches will be divided by the total number of cuisines in the reconciliation table to give the correctness.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Vertical Parent Correctness-</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'> A string comparison check on whether the vertical parent that Data Streams has for the vendor matches the local DWH</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Main Cuisine Name Correctness-</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'> A string comparison check on whether the attributes.name (where attributes.type=primary_cuisine) that Data Streams has for the vendor matches the main_cuisine_name in the reconciliation table from the local DWH</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Main Cuisine ID Correctness-</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'> A string comparison check on whether the main cuisine ID that Data Streams has for the vendor matches the local DWH</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Cuisine Correctness-</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'> A string comparison check made by left joining unnested Data Streams cuisines onto the unnested reconciliation table cuisines. The number of joins/matches will be divided by the total number of cuisines in the reconciliation table to give the correctness.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Characteristic Correctness-</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'> A string comparison check made by left joining unnested Data Streams characteristics onto the unnested reconciliation table characteristics. The number of joins/matches will be divided by the total number of cuisines in the reconciliation table to give the correctness.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Tag Correctness-</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'> A string comparison check made by left joining unnested Data Streams tags onto the unnested reconciliation table tags. The number of joins/matches will be divided by the total number of cuisines in the reconciliation table to give the correctness.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Halal Correctness-</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333'> A comparison check on whether the halal field that Data Streams has for the vendor matches the local DWH.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zone>
        </zone>
      </zones>
