                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Main Cuisine ID Correctness-</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333'> A string comparison check on whether the main cuisine ID that Data Streams has for the vendor matches the local DWH</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Cuisine Correctness-</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333'> A string comparison check made by left joining unnested Data Streams cuisines onto the unnested reconciliation table cuisines. The number of joins/matches will be divided by the total number of cuisines in the reconciliation table to give the correctness.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Characteristic Correctness-</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333'> A string comparison check made by left joining unnested Data Streams characteristics onto the unnested reconciliation table characteristics. The number of joins/matches will be divided by the total number of cuisines in the reconciliation table to give the correctness.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Tag Correctness-</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333'> A string comparison check made by left joining unnested Data Streams tags onto the unnested reconciliation table tags. The number of joins/matches will be divided by the total number of cuisines in the reconciliation table to give the correctness.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Halal Correctness-</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333'> A comparison check on whether the halal field that Data Streams has for the vendor matches the local DWH.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
